  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 103.51 Monitoring well",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 103.51 “Monitoring well” means a well used for the purpose of sampling groundwater or measuring groundwater elevations.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05 (from Env-Sw 103.43); ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 103.44) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
